    "body": "Epiphone proudly presents the new Les Paul™ Tribute, an incredible, affordable introduction to the world’s greatest electric guitar! The Les Paul Tribute has all the classic Les Paul features that have made this iconic instrument a worldwide favorite for decades. It boasts a carved mahogany top, powerful Epiphone 650R™ and 700T™ ceramic humbuckers™ with nickel covers, and a mahogany neck with a laurel fretboard and an easy-to-play tapered neck joint. It's a no-nonsense axe with all the playability and tone you'd expect from a Les Paul guitar. Available in multiple color options. Also offered in left-handed versions. An optional gig bag is also available."
